<Layout title="Privacy Policy - BLOGCITO" description="BLOGCITO's Privacy Policy. Learn how we manage, protect, and ensure the security of our readers' data and the use of cookies on the web.">
    <main class="container" style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1rem;">
        <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p>Last updated: June 2026</p>

        <h3>1. General Information</h3>
        <p>This document sets forth the Privacy Policy of BLOGCITO, operated under UYUX Digital. Your privacy is important to us, and this policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information when you visit our website.</p>

        <h3>2. Use of Cookies and Google AdSense</h3>
        <p>Our website uses third-party cookies to improve the user experience and display relevant ads. Specifically, we use Google AdSense to serve ads:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to our website or other websites.</li>
            <li>Google's use of advertising cookies (such as the DoubleClick cookie) enables it and its partners to serve ads to users based on their visit to our sites and/or other sites on the Internet.</li>
            <li>Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://myadcenter.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ads Settings</a>.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>3. Contact Information</h3>
        <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, the use of your data, or the ads displayed on the web, you can contact us through our contact section.</p>

        <h3>4. Affiliate Link Disclosure</h3>
        <p>BLOGCITO participates in various affiliate marketing programs (such as Impact, Booking, etc.), which means we may earn commissions on purchases made through our links to third-party sites. This does not alter the price you pay, nor does it affect our recommendations or opinions on the destinations and services mentioned.</p>
    </main>

</Layout>